OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FChance of a shower across the
OL,6,FBorders at first this morning.
OL,7,FOtherwise it will be a dry day with
OL,8,Fvariable amounts of cloud and sunny
OL,9,Fintervals.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry with
OL,12,Fsome late brightness. Then the rest of
OL,13,Fthe night will remain dry with clear
OL,14,Fperiods. Chilly in some sheltered
OL,15,Fglens.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FAfter a dry start rain will
OL,18,Freach the southwest in the morning,
OL,19,Fspreading to Edinburgh, Lothian and
OL,20,FBorders in the afternoon. Fresh
OL,21,Fsoutherly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
